out.push(A('⚠ **Make the room ask the question out loud: _which of these did I do first?_** **If more than one answer comes back, the paragraph has the fault.** This takes about ninety seconds a student and it is the fastest diagnostic in the unit. **Then Mr Hariri\'s sentence**, which the class should hear said rather than read: **most readers do not ask, they just believe the weaker version.**'));
out.push(S('Homework (sample)'));
