out.push(A('**208 words, the cost in the first sentence as a figure, the wrong sentence quoted and counted, what it was really about, and what she would keep.** ⚠ **The paragraph that earns the band is the fourth**, because it moves the advice off the words: **a note that stops at _do not say you are flexible_ has stopped one step early**, and the reader will say it anyway when the silence comes.'));
out.push(S('Stage 7P · Respond (sample slip — band 2)'));
