out.push(A('⚠ **Count the four seconds out loud as a room.** It is the only group exercise in this unit and it is not a game: **nobody finds four seconds of silence easy, and the room discovering that together is the content of the cycle.** **Then Mrs Sweidan\'s last line**, which should be said and not read: **the eyebrow is not a question, and you do not have to answer things that are not questions.**'));
