out.push(S('Stage 7R · Share'));
out.push(A('⚠ **Run it twice and write both lists on the board.** The room writes the figures heard from the page, then the figures heard without it. **Something always goes missing**, and the missing ones are almost always the bases. **Then Mrs Nasser\'s sentence**, which is the practical conclusion of the whole unit: **I can hold eight figures under pressure and I cannot hold three hundred and twenty words.**'));
out.push(S('Homework (sample)'));
